From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: S2a lab <s2a@lab>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 14:56:23 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Strings: join of flat strings in one pass, memchr search,
 inline ===

DadoScript fork patch F1-F3 (additive). Array.prototype.join over a fast array
of flat strings sizes the result once and copies once; String indexOf
(and every search through string_indexof: includes, split, replace)
finds the first character with memchr; === and !== on two flat strings
compare in the interpreter instead of through js_strict_eq_slow.
---
 quickjs.c                   | 118 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 tests/test_dados_strings.js |  47 ++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 163 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/test_dados_strings.js

